meters you’d like to pass with your placement. These can be referenced within the rules"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of your campaign. Keys beginning with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$"},{"text":" are reserved for Superwall and will be dropped. Values can be any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"JSON encodable value, URLs or Dates. Arrays and dictionaries as values are not supported at this time, and will","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be dropped.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"params"},{"name":"paywallOverrides","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/PaywallOverrides","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object whose parameters override the paywall defaults. Use this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to override products and whether it ignores the subscription status. Defaults to "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"onRequestDismiss","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional completion block that gets called when the paywall should dismiss. This defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will call ","type":"text"},{"code":"presentationMode.wrappedValue.dismiss()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by default. Otherwise you must perform the dismissal of the paywall.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"onErrorView","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A completion block that accepts an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"type":"text","text":" and returns a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":". This will show when the requested"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paywall is skipped. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"feature","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A completion block containing a feature that you wish to paywall. Access to this block is remotely configurable via the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com\/dashboard","type":"reference"},{"text":". If the paywall is set to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Non Gated","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", this will be called when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the paywall is dismissed or if the user is already paying. If the paywall is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Gated","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", this will be called only if the user is already paying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or if they begin paying. If no paywall is configured, this gets called immediately. This will not be called in the event of an error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This uses ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Superwall\/getPaywall(forPlacement:params:paywallOverrides:delegate:)"},{"text":" under the hood.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’re responsible for the deallocation of this view. If you have a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" presented somewhere"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and you try to present the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" elsewhere, you will get a crash."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"warning","name":"Warning"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/Paywal